usage: module-nav grep [-h] [-n N] [--module GREP_MODULE] [--type GREP_TYPE] pattern

positional arguments:
  pattern               Regex pattern (e.g. 'setPreferredSize')

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -n N                  Max results to show (default 30)
  --module, -m GREP_MODULE
                        Filter to a specific module (e.g. workbench-wb)
  --type, -t GREP_TYPE  Filter by submodule type: rt, wb, ux, doc, se, standalone
                        (<module>/<module>) or other (unknown suffix)
